---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Markdown Features">
  <h1>Markdown features</h1>
  <p class="muted">Supported capabilities in rendered preview.</p>

  <ul>
    <li>GitHub Flavored Markdown (tables, task lists, strikethrough, etc.).</li>
    <li>Mermaid diagrams via <code>```mermaid</code> fences.</li>
    <li>Callouts using blockquote syntax, e.g. <code>&gt; [!NOTE] Title</code>.</li>
    <li>Inline <code>&lt;kbd&gt;...&lt;/kbd&gt;</code> handling (rendered as keycaps).</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>

